1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:01,810
There are so many mortals here,

25
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:03,970
they should be brimming with life.

26
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:07,630
So why is this death aura so prevalent ?

27
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,770
For a year,

28
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:19,170
I travelled through many cities all over Xue Yue.

29
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:21,970
There are no royal families here.

30
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:24,250
Instead,

31
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:27,130
every city belongs to a powerful cultivator.

32
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:29,410
Here,

33
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:32,090
the mortals are slaves.

34
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:35,710
The only meaning to their life

35
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:38,390
is to carve ice sculptures for cultivators

36
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:40,930
in order to make a living.

37
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,250
Thank you Immortal !

38
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:45,290
Mortals should have life energy,

39
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:48,650
but this death aura is particularly deep...

40
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:51,410
I don't like this place

41
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:55,290
but I believe I can gain a better understanding of Death here.

42
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:59,850
The ice sculptures of Xue Yue are very special.

43
00:03:01,030 --> 00:03:03,230
The mortals carve the ice,

44
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:06,010
then a cultivator will place a formation on it

45
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:09,370
and use a secret technique.

46
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:13,370
The ice sculpture then comes to life and turns into a puppet.

47
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:15,810
This method is very mysterious...

48
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:18,090
I have been studying it for a long time

49
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:20,050
but I haven't learned anything yet.

50
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,450
My guess is

51
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:25,850
the ice sculptures are the foundation of Xue Yue.

52
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:27,690
If I can learn this method

53
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:29,800
and use it on wood carvings,

54
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:32,090
it will be very beneficial to me.

55
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,610
Xue Yue's defense has become weak

56
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:43,210
since the remnants of the Four Sect Alliance have been active.

57
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:46,650
Even if the Elders are not present,

58
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:50,510
these disorganized groups that fled the country won't pose a threat.

59
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:53,050
Let's deal with those who remained in Xue Yue first

60
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:55,410
and then we'll get rid of those who fled.

61
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:57,290
Let's take our time.

62
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:58,820
Senior Brother,

63
00:03:58,640 --> 00:04:02,250
are there still no news from the country of Suzaku ?

64
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,700
It's been several years

65
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:10,090
since the Elders went to Suzaku.

66
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:12,810
How can there be no news at all !?

67
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:17,210
The technique to forcefully raise the cultivation of an individual

68
00:04:17,180 --> 00:04:19,850
must not be easy to pull off.

69
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:22,610
Now that we have our new land,

70
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:25,210
to raise our country to rank 5

71
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:28,530
we need a cultivator to reach Soul Transformation.

72
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,930
There's no other way.

73
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:34,130
The empowerment ceremony is too risky !

74
00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:36,570
Everyone only has one shot at it.

75
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:39,010
Even if one reaches Soul Transformation,

76
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:41,210
he will only have 100 years of lifespan

77
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:44,090
and will forever be stuck at Early stage

78
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:45,850
without being able to breakthrough !

79
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:49,370
I hope that among the Elders

80
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:52,650
at least one will be able to reach Soul Transformation.

81
00:04:53,640 --> 00:04:56,050
That way, we will have 100 years

82
00:04:56,440 --> 00:04:59,690
to solidify our position as rank 5.

83
00:05:06,630 --> 00:05:08,090
It seems

84
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:12,050
that Xue Yue is governed locally by City Lords.

85
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:17,130
So their strength must vary from city to city.

86
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:20,570
11 floors ?

87
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,130
Who...

88
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:33,330
Sun Shouyi
72nd Xue Yue City Lord
Late stage Core Formation

89
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:33,330
Who are you ?

90
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:36,490
I need your identity.

91
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,270
How dare you !

92
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,770
I'm the City Lord !

93
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:57,450
Master.

94
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,930
 Sun Shouyi's third disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

95
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,930
Sun Shouyi's second disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

96
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:06,290
According to this person's memory,

97
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:09,330
this girl often serves him personally.

98
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,570
Master...

99
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:14,250
I didn't expect that in Xue Yue,

100
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:18,570
a disciple serving his master would be so common.

101
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,610
Have any new ice embryos arrived ?

102
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:23,530
Master,

103
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:26,010
2 of them just arrived.

104
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,400
Bring them out

105
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:31,130
and let me see if your skills have improved.

106
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:31,890
Understood.

107
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,690
According to this person's memory,

108
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,650
the technique's first step

109
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:13,770
is to construct 9 blood veins in the ice embryo.

110
00:07:13,890 --> 00:07:15,010
The next step

111
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:19,370
is to use the Icy Snow Tactic of Xue Yue to activate it.

112
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,290
Master...

113
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:27,930
You haven't answered my question from a few days ago

114
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:30,890
so disciple's cultivation is having problems.

115
00:07:31,080 --> 00:07:33,970
Please come and instruct me tonight.

116
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,770
Speak,

117
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:36,010
what's the issue ?

118
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:41,290
Master...

119
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:43,370
Do we talk about it here ?

120
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:55,730
Master,

121
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,730
disciple was wrong !

122
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:58,210
I didn't think straight.

123
00:07:59,230 --> 00:08:00,370
Continue.

124
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,970
Bones of ice,

125
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,610
soul of snow !

126
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,730
Disciple

127
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,970
failed again.

128
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,650
According to this person's memory,

129
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:27,650
the Icy Snow Tactic emphasizes refining the heart.

130
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:30,890
This technique uses ice as the bones and snow as the soul

131
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:33,440
to form an ice and snow soul

132
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:35,770
and reach the state of a clear heart.

133
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:38,210
It's very meticulous but unstable.

134
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:40,050
There is no room for error.

135
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:42,250
Senior Brother is back !

136
00:08:44,880 --> 00:08:46,450
Disciple greets Master.

137
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:47,770
I have found the place

138
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:50,130
where remnants of the Four Sect Alliance are hiding.

139
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:52,690
How about

140
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:55,290
we call Zhao Li of the Ice Snow Palace

141
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:57,210
and ask them to send...

142
00:08:56,740 --> 00:08:57,650
Lead the way.

143
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:12,090
Master,

144
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,210
it's right here.

145
00:09:14,890 --> 00:09:17,090
I sense a restriction that's guarding 2 cultivators.

146
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:19,690
One is just a Core Formation.

147
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:21,730
The other one

148
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:23,730
oscillates between Core Formation

149
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,250
and Nascent Soul.

150
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:28,650
There are even hints of Soul Formation.

151
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:32,170
It looks like his cultivation is collapsing

152
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,650
and he's about to die.

153
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:35,330
You wait here.

154
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:39,530
Master never took risks himself before...

155
00:09:58,400 --> 00:10:00,490
Chen Huan
Black Soul Sect Junior Sect Leader 
Early stage Core Formation

156
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:13,730
Please don't kill my master,

157
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:15,090
kill me instead !

158
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:17,450
I'm the Junior Sect Leader of the Black Soul Sect.

159
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,530
If you capture me,

160
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:19,290
you will be rewarded.

161
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:21,690
Please spare my master.

162
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:25,290
Why do you want to exchange your life for your master's ?

163
00:10:25,670 --> 00:10:27,530
If my master didn't have

164
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:29,290
to drag me around,

165
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:32,330
he would have left a long time ago.

166
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,690
But he tried to save me...

167
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:34,890
Huan'er,

168
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,650
get up.

169
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:39,970
This person is not a cultivator of Xue Yue.

170
00:10:40,680 --> 00:10:41,650
Master...

171
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:42,930
you're awake !

172
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:46,130
Junior greets Senior of the Black Soul Sect.

173
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:49,470
This person is surronded by a death aura,

174
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:51,520
he's about to die.

175
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:53,260
He's beyond saving.

176
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:54,490
Little friend,

177
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:57,570
this old man's body is too injured

178
00:10:57,520 --> 00:10:59,490
to greet you properly.

179
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:01,770
I hope you will forgive me.

180
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:03,090
Senior's hiding place

181
00:11:03,280 --> 00:11:05,850
has been found by Xue Yue cultivators

182
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:07,770
so it's best to leave now.

183
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:11,490
I've lived in the Four Sects Alliance for more than 30 years.

184
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:12,970
But I couldn't help much

185
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:14,330
during the war with Xue Yue.

186
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,530
This time,

187
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:18,770
I will do my best to help.

188
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,530
Your injury is too serious

189
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:24,770
for this bottle of pills to heal, but it can ease the pain.

190
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:27,340
This should allow you to leave this place.

191
00:11:27,880 --> 00:11:29,370
The world is big

192
00:11:29,190 --> 00:11:30,920
so there might be other chances

193
00:11:30,680 --> 00:11:32,810
to recover your cultivation.

194
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,410
Little friend,

195
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:37,720
I don't know what Sect you're from,

196
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:39,770
but if I wanted to leave,

197
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:42,850
I could have left back then.

198
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:45,130
Even if it means,

199
00:11:44,880 --> 00:11:48,170
speeding up the loss of my cultivation.

200
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:50,730
I can still leave right now.

201
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:51,850
However,

202
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:55,570
do you know why I don't want to leave ?

203
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:02,570
This is my home.

204
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:05,890
I was born here

205
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:07,290
and when I die,

206
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:10,490
it will also be here.

207
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,370
Little friend,

208
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:21,330
this artifact is for you.

209
00:12:25,640 --> 00:12:28,810
It's to thank you for the pills you've given me.

210
00:12:35,680 --> 00:12:36,890
Thank you, Senior.

211
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:39,850
Huan'er,

212
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:41,410
it's time to go.

213
00:12:41,230 --> 00:12:42,290
Master,

214
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:43,450
where are we going ?

215
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,850
I woke up today

216
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:47,410
like a candle before it's extinguished.

217
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:53,170
Go,

218
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:57,130
you will have to rely on yourself in the future

219
00:12:57,400 --> 00:13:00,250
because Master can't protect you anymore.

220
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,050
No...

221
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,370
Master...

222
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:04,290
don't...

223
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:07,930
Master !

224
00:13:39,520 --> 00:13:41,170
Master !

225
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:45,050
You bastards of Xue Yue...

226
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:46,530
Come here !

227
00:13:46,800 --> 00:13:48,930
Even if I die today,

228
00:13:49,270 --> 00:13:50,650
I will die

229
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:53,610
while protecting my country !

230
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:32,010
The fake Red Butterfly's sacrifice...

231
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:34,890
The fear of death of Xue Yue's mortals...

232
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:38,770
The generosity of this Senior towards me...

233
00:14:40,040 --> 00:14:42,170
Master !!!

234
00:14:43,040 --> 00:14:44,850
It turns out that Death

235
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,930
has many different meanings.

236
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:55,890
3 years later

237
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:58,740
Spring and autumn pass by,

238
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:01,290
snow falls as winter comes again.

239
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:06,610
My research on the ice sculptures

240
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:08,650
has made some progress.

241
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:13,370
The ice sculptures are maintained by the blood veins.

242
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:16,530
A sculpture with 49 blood veins

243
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:19,170
is able to achieve Core Formation level.

244
00:15:20,880 --> 00:15:22,890
The more blood veins in the sculpture,

245
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,730
the stronger it is.

246
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:27,770
But if they collide with each other,

247
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:30,730
the sculpture will collapse.

248
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:33,730
This Icy Snow Tactic

249
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:36,010
cannot be considered correct.

250
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:40,050
It's definitely a branch of something else.

251
00:15:40,640 --> 00:15:44,210
It's similar to the Six Desire Devil Lord's cultivation method.

252
00:15:47,680 --> 00:15:49,090
Instead of snow blood,

253
00:15:49,400 --> 00:15:51,770
these veins use pure blood.

254
00:15:52,560 --> 00:15:55,730
This way I give it a bit of Life and Death Domain

255
00:15:56,230 --> 00:15:58,320
to be able to control it.

256
00:16:10,400 --> 00:16:12,010
4 years have passed.

257
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:15,490
It's time to leave.

258
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:53,970
In the war,

259
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:56,410
I've seen many deaths.

260
00:16:58,160 --> 00:17:01,690
My feelings towards Death are still profound.

261
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:12,440
Master,

262
00:17:12,320 --> 00:17:13,810
where are we going now ?

263
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:18,890
I will return to my roots.

264
00:17:20,560 --> 00:17:22,490
But where is my home ?

265
00:17:38,040 --> 00:17:40,210
I'm a year away from Soul Formation.

266
00:17:40,040 --> 00:17:41,570
I was born in Zhao,

267
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:43,410
so I will return to Zhao.

268
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:46,010
That's the law of cause and effect.

269
00:17:55,510 --> 00:20:42,360
“I, Chen Huan, swear that I’ll wipe out Xue Yue !”
Wang Lin returned to the ice tower with a complicated state of mind. Although he had obtained a powerful artifact, he didn’t feel happy. He only felt a sense of melancholy.
At this moment, Wang Lin suddenly gained another bit of insight of his Life and Death Domain.

“What is Life… what is Death…”

This question echoed in Wang Lin’s mind.
The late stage Soul Formation cultivator of the Black Soul Sect used the last of his cultivation to fly up to the snow fairy statue at the Divine Temple of Snow and Ice. Like a moth flying toward a flame, he exploded on the statue, leaving behind a red mark that they couldn’t get rid of.
Along with him, several other Soul Formation cultivators were killed in this explosion.
All the glory was now gone with the wind…
In his death, he died at the right spot. His death awakened the Four Sect Alliance cultivators that hadn’t dared to show their faces.

In the blink of an eye, another year passed.

Throughout this year, Wang Lin kept thinking about the Life and Death Domain, and he gradually gained more insight. His own being had undergone a transformation in this past year.
Looking at a mountain as a mountain, looking at a river as a river.
However, Wang Lin noticed that sometimes a mountain isn’t a mountain and a river isn’t a river. It was as if there was another layer of fog blocking his eyes. He couldn’t see it, but he could feel it. When he reached out, he couldn’t touch it.
This type of thing won’t go away with time. He would need a sudden burst of insight to get past the fog.

270
00:18:03,890 --> 00:18:08,020
I've had my share of wounds,

271
00:18:05,930 --> 00:18:08,020
now I want to fight back.

272
00:18:07,850 --> 00:18:11,580
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

273
00:18:11,410 --> 00:18:17,500
that's blocking all my hopes

274
00:18:14,290 --> 00:18:17,500
for life ?

275
00:18:19,050 --> 00:18:23,260
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

276
00:18:20,770 --> 00:18:23,260
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

277
00:18:23,330 --> 00:18:26,660
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

278
00:18:26,770 --> 00:18:32,660
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

279
00:18:29,490 --> 00:18:32,660
out of reach.

280
00:18:33,770 --> 00:18:38,140
Immortals

281
00:18:34,810 --> 00:18:38,140
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

282
00:18:38,170 --> 00:18:42,180
Renegades

283
00:18:38,930 --> 00:18:42,180
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

284
00:18:41,930 --> 00:18:46,020
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

285
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:46,020
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

286
00:18:46,010 --> 00:18:50,140
because I don't see the harm in that.

287
00:18:51,890 --> 00:18:57,940
My new body opens its eyes

288
00:18:54,410 --> 00:18:57,940
and awakens from its dream.

289
00:18:57,810 --> 00:19:05,500
I have overcome many trials

290
00:18:59,930 --> 00:19:05,500
to get this body back.

291
00:19:05,450 --> 00:19:13,140
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

292
00:19:09,490 --> 00:19:13,140
I can still see.

293
00:19:13,290 --> 00:19:22,500
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

294
00:19:17,250 --> 00:19:22,500
by my own hands.

295
00:19:53,130 --> 00:19:59,340
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

296
00:19:55,850 --> 00:19:59,340
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

297
00:19:59,090 --> 00:20:06,900
With a flick of a finger,

298
00:20:00,530 --> 00:20:06,900
only my indomitable heart remains.

299
00:20:06,690 --> 00:20:16,300
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

300
00:20:12,650 --> 00:20:16,300
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

301
00:20:16,290 --> 00:20:24,140
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

302
00:20:18,810 --> 00:20:24,140
like the descent of a god.
